body:
1.  SUBJECTS OF INTEREST TO US INCLUDE THE FOLLOWING:
(A)  TIMING AND NATURE OF CEAUSESCU'S NEXT VISIT TO THE
USSR;
(B) SOVIET REACTION TO CEAUSESCU'S ASIAN JOURNEY;
(C) EXPECTED TREND OF SOVIET-ROMANIAN TRADE RELATIONS,
INCLUDING SOVIET SUPPLY OF RAW MATERIALS TO ROMANIA;
(D) ROMANIAN-SOVIET MILITARY RELATIONS; AND
(E) SOVIET VIEW OF MINORITY QUESTION  IN ROMANIA.
2.  LAST TWO TOPICS ABOVE WILL REQUIRE DISCREET HANDLING.
VANCE

